(a) the relation between the vectors of displacement current density $\mathbf{j}_d$ and conduction current density $\mathbf{j}$ at an arbitrary point of the medium;
(b) the displacement current across an arbitrary closed surface enclosing the internal sphere, if at the given moment the charge of that sphere is $q$.

